---
// Footer Duplex: tre colonne (mobile in stack), dicitura legale piccola in fondo
// con la menzione MCF (unico punto della pagina dove appare il brand MCF).
---

<footer class="dx-footer">
  <div class="dx-footer__inner">
    <div class="dx-footer__cols">
      <div class="dx-footer__col">
        <h3 class="dx-footer__h">Duplex Italia</h3>
        <p class="dx-footer__p">Duplex Italia Srl</p>
        <p class="dx-footer__p">Firenze</p>
        <p class="dx-footer__p"><a href="https://www.duplex-italia.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.duplex-italia.com</a></p>
        <p class="dx-footer__p dx-footer__hint">Dati di contatto da confermare</p>
      </div>

      <div class="dx-footer__col">
        <h3 class="dx-footer__h">Link utili</h3>
        <ul class="dx-footer__list">
          <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cookie">Cookie</a></li>
          <li><a href="/termini">Termini</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="dx-footer__col">
        <h3 class="dx-footer__h">Contatti</h3>
        <p class="dx-footer__p">Per assistenza sulla pratica:</p>
        <p class="dx-footer__p"><a href="mailto:mediocreditofacile@gmail.com">mediocreditofacile@gmail.com</a></p>
        <p class="dx-footer__p"><a href="tel:+393939957840">+39 393 995 7840</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="dx-footer__legal">
      Mediazione del credito a cura di Mediocredito Facile (Alberto Amà), iscritto OAM n. xxxxx.
      La presente pagina è uno strumento informativo non vincolante. Le condizioni finali sono
      definite dal contratto di locazione.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .dx-footer {
    background: #14283d;
    color: #d8dde3;
    padding: 48px 0 24px;
  }
  .dx-footer__inner {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  .dx-footer__cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .dx-footer__col h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  .dx-footer__h {
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }
  .dx-footer__p,
  .dx-footer__list li {
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    color: #c5cad2;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .dx-footer__list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .dx-footer__hint { font-size: 12px; color: #8a93a0; margin-top: 8px; font-style: italic; }
  .dx-footer a { color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; }
  .dx-footer a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--dx-orange, #E66A2C); }
  .dx-footer__legal {
    border-top: 1px solid #2a3f55;
    padding-top: 18px;
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #8a93a0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .dx-footer__cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1.2fr;
    }
  }
</style>
